WEBVTT

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.060
The village had put up with it for a long time.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.810
It had had everything taken from it.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.100
It had been injured.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.980
And even after being knocked to the ground,

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.030
it had never complained.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:09.060
<b>Sixth Hour: Yui</b>

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.190
I'm off!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.140
Oh, Hirose—

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.370
No way.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:36.250
That can't be!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.120
We made a promise...

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.570
We'd only stay together going
to and from school.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.830
Yeah, but Hinata-chan said

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.800
she wanted to be with you during school, too.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.180
Can we?

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:51.560
I already told you...

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.390
I'm not mad anymore.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.290
That's not it.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:02.890
Hinata-chan doesn't want
you to forgive her.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.630
She wants to be with you,

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.730
just like she was before... As a friend.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:13.020
I know I don't have any right to ask this,

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.440
but can we go back to how we were?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.340
You're the one who has to answer her.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:34.110
I made us some tea,
so let me know if you'd like some.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:37.280
Wow, that smells good!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.800
What about the school lunch?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.240
I'll make sure I get it,

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.370
but I wanted to make a lunch for us.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:48.810
You made me some fried egg again.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.700
It's sweet.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.280
Yeah, Kohinata-san likes them sweet.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.560
Oh, I see!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:57.750
Hayami-chan, have some.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.990
I don't really need anything...

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:06.360
If you want something,
I think you should be honest.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.760
Shut up!

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:13.320
I don't like people doing things for me.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:16.630
Besides, bringing a lunch makes no sense
when we have the school lunches.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:20.970
Here you go.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.640
I thought I was gonna die.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:31.510
Don't laugh.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.820
Yui-san.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.300
It's against the rules to bring food to school.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.030
You're the class rep. You must know that.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:46.800
And what are you doing,
sneaking around with this cockroach?

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.770
You're from the Kagura household!

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:56.130
Is it wrong?

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:58.740
Hinata-chan.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.840
Is it wrong?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.570
Hinata is Kohinata-san's friend.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.240
That's why I'm with her.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.710
There's nothing more to it than that.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:11.020
You know what her family did, right?

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:11.740
They—

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.760
That's all in the past!

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:16.570
Kohinata-san had nothing
to do with any of that!

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.500
No.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.360
Stop.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.260
Hirose...

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.500
Hinata-chan came back.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.670
She came back, with the resolve
to stay by your side.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.740
Are you really planning on
staying with that cockroach?

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.890
All three of them are cockroaches!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.370
Get rid of all of them!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.580
B-But Yui-sama...

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:44.860
If we do that, who knows what
the Kagura house will do to us?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.690
Yeah, this is bad, Yui-chan...

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.120
Shut up!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:07.000
I'll never forgive you, no matter what!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.340
No matter what!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.610
You should apologize!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.270
The Village Head will hear about this!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.220
Hmph!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.260
She's totally ignoring you.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.640
This is Kohinata's...

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:37.400
It's kind of small, but make yourself at home.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.510
This is my house, you know?

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:43.520
I never would have imagined she
was staying in a place this rundown.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.290
Hey, Hinata-chan.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:47.560
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:50.050
I didn't mean rundown, like "rundown."

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.850
I meant...

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:54.730
It is rundown, but it has
its convenient points, too.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.170
I can bring the bed out really quickly,

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.180
and any books I want to read are right there.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:04.740
It really is nice!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:07.130
That's not all.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.440
The gondola next to this one is a kitchen,

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.840
and you can take baths here.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.660
It's an outdoor bath.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.000
It's not that warm, but yeah.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:23.090
But Hirose-sama, how do you know
so much about her place?

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:26.570
Have you taken a bath

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.690
with K-Kohinata-san in this spring...

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.310
I-I wouldn't take a bath with this pervert!

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.660
That's mean!

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.840
That was an accident!

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.020
I didn't know you were naked...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:39.640
Naked?

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.030
You should watch out for him, too.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.060
He looks like a nice guy,

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.360
but he'll feel you up without
as much flinching.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.750
What? A-Actually, now that I think about it...

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:53.150
No, that was a...

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.850
The sun's setting.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:56.970
Go home.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:57.880
I see.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:00.620
Anyway, I'll be back tomorrow.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.220
Really?

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.920
If you spend any more time with me,

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.100
Yui's really going to get pissed.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.990
I think it'll work out somehow.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.240
I think, deep down, Yui-chan's a nice girl.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.610
That has nothing to do with it.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:15.040
Huh?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.880
She'll never be able to forgive me,

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:21.980
no matter how nice she is.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.520
The Kohinata family were the ones

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.000
who killed her grandfather.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.230
<i>Grandpa!</i>

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.920
<i>Y-Yui...</i>

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.060
<i>Do we have any medicine?!</i>

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.800
<i>What about a doctor?</i>

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.260
<i>We've asked several times,
but Kohinata-sama</i>

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.940
<i>said we needed to pay...</i>

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.470
<i>They've taken plenty from us.</i>

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:48.100
<i>How could we have anything left?</i>

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.480
<i>Why? Why are they treating us like this?!</i>

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.700
<i>Grandpa, don't die!</i>

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.970
<i>Grandpa!</i>

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.720
<i>Grandpa!</i>

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.330
Yui, it's time to eat.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.150
Okay!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.000
The villagers finally stood up,

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:15.000
to fight the tyranny of the Kohinata family,

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.240
who used their power to take from the village.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.370
It was the Kagura family who led the charge.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.180
The villagers joined together and
threw the Kohinata family out.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.660
The Kohinata family met with ruin,

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:30.110
and they all went their own directions.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.810
And thus, the Kagura family...

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.750
So that's what happened...

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.080
Thank you for bringing me back.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.610
Anyway, I'll be heading in now.

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:40.120
Right.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:40.860
Talk to you later.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.360
Sure.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.760
Where did you go?

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:04.320
Are you not Hinata?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.860
Tacky!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:19.800
He's never around,
and my role in his life is fading...

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.770
I'm just gonna go back to bed and stay there!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.200
It smells like Tacky.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.730
What should we do?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.990
Oh, I know. How about a
crêpe special, with lots of bananas?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.150
Maybe I'll get a hair tie.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.130
I think you're misunderstanding something.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:43.320
I just said I'd pay for the bus.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.210
Pay for the rest yourselves.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.670
No!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:50.600
We're just here because you
asked us to come...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.330
The town is fun, but it costs money.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.440
I need to take my mind off everything,

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.290
or I'm going to explode.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.590
It's been a while since we've been to town.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:11.020
Oh, the stores have changed!
Can I go take a look?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.510
I said I didn't need it!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.480
It'd be a waste.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.750
It's fine.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:16.950
That voice just now...

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.320
I told you I didn't need these clothes.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.130
Maki-san, Hamaji-san.

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:33.070
This sucks.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.080
I didn't think Hirose-kun and the rest
of you would be here, too.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.120
It'd be a shame to waste this nice break now.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.580
We all came to go shopping for clothes.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.220
That means—

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.780
I'm leaving.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.060
I shouldn't have come.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:56.880
Wait.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.860
We're all together. Let's all hang out.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.980
That shouldn't be a problem, right?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.840
No, even if the world crumbles to pieces!

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:09.770
Excuse me.

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.710
Who ordered the "Whispers on
a Plateau" special?

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.930
I didn't expect it to be this big!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.970
Yui-chan, you splurged quite a bit.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.160
Now get to it!

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.100
I know!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.970
I won't lose to that cockroach!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.430
Wow!

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.900
They're good.

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.080
Kohinata-san...

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.810
Hayami-chan hates to lose
more than you'd guess.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.740
It's a spurt!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.580
Wait. Are you okay, Yui-chan?

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.120
Looks like a draw.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.150
Ta-dah! What do you think?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.030
Don't try stuff on,

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.590
when you don't have the money for it.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:26.660
But it's cute!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.230
I'm going to try that on, too!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:32.300
Well, it's not that bad.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.510
I'm wearing it,

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:37.140
so something a bit fancier
would be better, but...

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:39.500
Oh, that looks good.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.960
Of course it does. I'm wear—

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.020
It looks really nice.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:46.460
I told you I don't need this!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:50.470
Sorry. I just thought it'd look
really great on you.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.140
Excuse me, ma'am!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.610
Bring me the most expensive
clothes in the store!

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.330
Yui-chan, are you sure that's okay?

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.860
Who do you think I am?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.730
I'm going to spend all the New Year's money

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.090
I've been saving for three years, at once!

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.420
Now, hurry!

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:11.730
It feels like we're headed
in the right direction,

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:13.360
but at the same time, maybe not so much...

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:15.980
Probably the right one, I think.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.200
I'm not sure.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.050
Huh? Otoha-chan?

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.690
What do you think? Does it look good?

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.590
I guess spirits dress up, too.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.100
Of course!

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.400
If you don't wear proper clothing

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.210
to the spirit meetings,

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:28.010
they'll get mad.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:31.510
Besides, it's almost time.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.550
Time?

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.850
Yeah, make sure you keep it in mind.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.660
Your time isn't unlimited.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.590
Time...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.540
She's always comes and goes,
where you'd least expect it.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.000
It's hard to walk...

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.770
Were those the most expensive
clothes they had?

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.270
Looks like it.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.330
Are those stilts? Are those stilts?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.380
Shut up!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.760
Does she plan to go all the
way home, wearing that?

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.420
Hopefully, she won't fall in the fields.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.620
Oh, here's the thing Yui-chan's good at.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.490
How about you give it at try,
since it's been a while?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.630
Good idea.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.800
Cockroach, it's on!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.230
Huh?

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.670
The rules are simple.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:29.070
One chance to see who can punch harder.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.770
Here I go!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.140
<i>Combine crash!</i>

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.260
That's Yui-chan for you!

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:45.820
You're not helping your family out,
every day, for nothing.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.420
Of course.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.460
Now do you understand?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.530
You cockroaches and I are made
completely differently...

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:10.880
It looks like a new record...

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.380
I took that punch once...

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.610
Wow!

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:18.550
How did you hit it? How did you hit it?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.560
Just kind of like this.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.560
Kind of like?

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:25.530
If Yuki learned how to do that,
she'd be really happy!

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.100
Yui-chan!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.120
She left...

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.510
She must have been really frustrated.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.770
I wonder if she's okay.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:35.270
Huh?

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.990
Isn't this Yui-chan's wallet?

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:40.420
That means she...

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:45.280
This didn't even manage
to keep me distracted.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:46.320
God...

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.940
It's not here.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.150
Did I...

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:55.330
But if I go back now...

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:04.100
Yui-chan!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.400
Yui-chan?

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:11.280
Everyone, the last bus is here.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.280
What should we do?

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.880
But we have to go after her!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.050
Yeah, but if the this bus leaves,

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.280
we won't be able to get home, either.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.510
She probably took the mountain path.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:24.120
Huh?

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.390
There's a single path that
takes you to the village.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:29.530
It's a pretty tough route, though.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.880
Get on the bus.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.760
What? We can't do that!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.830
I know a lot about the mountain.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.700
I can go more easily by myself.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.630
Hayami-chan...

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.400
I won't give in!
This isn't enough to stop me...

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.420
Jeez...

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.560
I really should go back and
make up with everyone.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.310
No, if I do that,

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.430
that cockroach will never
let me live this down!

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.530
I won't forgive her.

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:14.270
She stole everything from the village.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:19.240
Food, families, people... Everything.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.010
Ow...

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:33.360
This is...

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.400
My house.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:46.970
It's been burned down, and there's
nothing left. But it's still my house.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.750
I won't try to make any excuses.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:53.490
My parents and my grandparents

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:56.410
caused the people of this village to suffer.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:19:01.150
They used their power to take
everything from everyone.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:05.090
That's right. You took him from me.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:07.860
Someone precious to me.

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:10.270
Someone who had done no wrong.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:14.180
That's exactly why I won't forgive
you for what happened!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:18.370
Had any of you harbored the
slightest kindness, no one needed to die!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.170
If you'd only given a little,
he would have lived!

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:28.410
Give them back!
Give back my grandfather!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.930
All the people in the village who died!

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:32.580
All the people who died, crying!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.020
Give them all back!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.940
Who cares if you had your house burned down?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.960
That's what you deserve!

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.730
I won't pity you, no matter how sad you look!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:43.430
I'll despise and hate you, for my grandfather,
who isn't here anymore!

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.030
Yes, I know.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:53.970
The only thing I can do is to accept
the village's hatred.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.910
That's all I can do...

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:05.740
What the hell?!

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.080
Take this!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:07.980
Begone!

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.420
Begone and disappear!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.490
All of it!

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:12.420
All of it!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.490
All of it...

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:16.760
All of...

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:28.840
I'm sorry.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.100
I have nothing left to give.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:40.290
My parents... My house... My way of life...

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.720
I have none of them anymore.

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:05.370
<i>Mom, did you make the
fried egg sweet enough?</i>

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:07.510
<i>Yep, I made them plenty sweet.</i>

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:09.180
<i>Really?</i>

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:35.710
Today, I'm on lunch duty!

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.270
Now, everyone line up!

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.310
She's pretty happy, given that she
was lost in the mountains.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.710
Yeah, I'm glad.

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:53.000
There was some fried egg left over,
so I'm giving it to you special.

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:55.230
I don't need it.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.410
Just take it!

00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:59.500
Now... We're even...

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.200
You should eat it.

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:21.580
Is it sweet?

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.000
All the red swamp crayfish, the natural enemy

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.690
of any rice plant, have disappeared
from the fields!

00:24:04.690 --> 00:24:05.520
<b>Hiccup.</b>

00:24:07.390 --> 00:24:09.530
Wait, Kohinata...

00:24:09.530 --> 00:24:11.770
I was hungry. That's all.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:14.800
<b>Seventh Hour: Hotaru</b>

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:14.730
I can't believe you.
